"The attack struck Chicago around Halloween, about seven years before Hannah's funeral."
"Dispatch underestimated the villain and sent only Hannah Elber and Arjun Thomas."
"Arjun tackled the villain through a building under remodel and across the street."
"The fight crashed into the Thorn family's new apartment, a few blocks from the nightclub."
"The villain's energy bursts went off twice a second apart, then again 90 seconds later."
"Richard and Leah Thorn lay buried under debris from the floor above and the roof."
"Hannah froze eight-year-old Alden Thorn in a Bubble of Patient Waiting to stop his bleeding."
"Hannah took the blame, saying she stabilized the 8th floor instead of the 7th."
"Some websites list the Thorns as collateral damage; hate sites blame the heroes."
"The apartment building was later repaired and is still apartments."
